    "good_play": "The Rangers are the threat: they shoot Hymnal's Soldier every turn without retaliation, and they are weak in melee (8 strength) and get no terrain defence. Keep Hymnal's Soldier fortified until a Ranger stands adjacent in the open, then strike it and step back; never trade blows with a full-health Mongol Soldier outside the walls. Bring Soldier #21 back into Requiem Deep, finish the Ranger there (34 Production stored) and walk it to Hymnal to shoot back from inside the city. Switch Hymnal to a Ranger too. Walls can't arrive inside 15 turns, so don't detour into Fortification. Offer peace once two Mongol units are down.",
